  "body": "Nestled amongst native trees and bush, this weatherboard home enjoys a private, leafy setting and offers plenty of appeal to first-home buyers, young families and investors.\r\n\r\nLocated down a shared right-of-way, the home enjoys a peaceful bush setting, with tui often heard amongst the trees. Yet, when it's time to head out, Browns Bay beach, shops and local amenities are just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nSet over two levels, the home offers a practical, easy-living layout:\r\n- Downstairs, the open-plan living and dining area flows onto a spacious deck, providing a spot to unwind, entertain or enjoy the surrounding bush outlook. A bathroom and laundry add convenience to this level, while the spacious garage with internal access is a welcome bonus.\r\n- Upstairs, three bedrooms and the family bathroom provide a separate space from the hub of everyday living.\r\n\r\nIn zone for Long Bay College and other great schools, this home offers privacy, convenience and exciting potential - come see the possibilities!\r\n\r\nNOTE: Some decor in property photos have been AI enhanced. \r\n\r\nTO VIEW THE PROPERTY DOCS, copy & paste the following link into your browser: www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/DLF1",
